  <data key="d2">A type of electrical bridge circuit used for measurement in Direct Current systems, mentioned in the context of Chapter 3.</data>
  <data key="d3">chap 3 DC&amp;AC BRIDGES::ch_00000-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
