<node id="Ra">
  <data key="d0">Ra</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A fixed resistor in the circuit with a resistance value of 1KΩ.&lt;SEP&gt;A resistance component in the Kelvin Bridge circuit with a defined ratio relationship to Rb.&lt;SEP&gt;A resistance component within a set used to compensate for low lead contact resistance, with a ratio to Rb determined by R1 and R3.</data>
  <data key="d3">Lab1::ch_00008-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;chap 3 DC&amp;AC BRIDGES::ch_00023-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;chap 3 DC&amp;AC BRIDGES::ch_00022-chunk-000</data>
