  <data key="d0">Rb</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The variable component in the circuit for which five specific resistors (Rb1 to Rb5) are selected from a supply of 100kΩ resistors.&lt;SEP&gt;A resistance component in the Kelvin Bridge circuit used to establish a ratio with Ra.&lt;SEP&gt;A resistance component paired with Ra to compensate for low lead contact resistance, forming a ratio based on R1 and R3.</data>
  <data key="d3">Lab1::ch_00008-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;chap 3 DC&amp;AC BRIDGES::ch_00023-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;chap 3 DC&amp;AC BRIDGES::ch_00022-chunk-000</data>
