<node id="Integrator">
  <data key="d0">Integrator</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A component whose output voltage level depends on the RC product and is affected by temperature changes in resistance and capacitance.&lt;SEP&gt;A component capable of performing integration, producing an output that varies with time and charge.&lt;SEP&gt;An electronic component or circuit block that performs integration of an input signal, producing an output voltage during the discharge period.&lt;SEP&gt;A circuit component that stores charge, which is removed by the negative reference voltage until the charge becomes zero.</data>
  <data key="d3">chapter 5  ADC and DAC::ch_00035-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;chapter 5  ADC and DAC::ch_00034-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;chapter 5  ADC and DAC::ch_00039-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;chapter 5  ADC and DAC::ch_00038-chunk-000</data>
