  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Resistance">
  <data key="d0">Resistance</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A component parameter that, along with capacitance, affects the integrator output when varying with temperature.&lt;SEP&gt;A circuit parameter represented by R in the text, existing in various arms of the bridge and used to determine other impedance values.</data>
