  <data key="d2">DAC is a Digital-to-Analog Converter, a device described as ideally producing a linear relationship between digital input and analog output.&lt;SEP&gt;Data converter whose output voltage accuracy is being analyzed&lt;SEP&gt;A Digital-to-Analog Converter that receives the counter's output to generate a staircase ramp.</data>
