<node id="Kelvin Bridge">
  <data key="d0">Kelvin Bridge</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A specific electrical bridge circuit configuration depicted in Figure 3.9 and referenced in Example 3.6.&lt;SEP&gt;A modified version of the Wheatstone Bridge designed to eliminate contact and lead resistance for measuring unknown low resistances with high accuracy.&lt;SEP&gt;A specific type of Direct Current Bridge circuit.</data>
  <data key="d3">chap 3 DC&amp;AC BRIDGES::ch_00023-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;chap 3 DC&amp;AC BRIDGES::ch_00021-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;chap 3 DC&amp;AC BRIDGES::ch_00001-chunk-000</data>
