  <data key="d0">Figure 3.9</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">An illustrative diagram associated with Example 3.6 that depicts the Kelvin Bridge and its components.</data>
  <data key="d3">chap 3 DC&amp;AC BRIDGES::ch_00023-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
