<node id="Absolute Error">
  <data key="d0">Absolute Error</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A metric calculated by determining the difference between the expected value and the measured value.&lt;SEP&gt;Absolute Error is defined as the difference between the expected value and the measured value of a variable.&lt;SEP&gt;The difference between the measured value and the expected value, used in the calculation of percent error.</data>
