<node id="Relative Accuracy">
  <data key="d0">Relative Accuracy</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A metric that quantifies the accuracy of the measurement relative to the expected value.&lt;SEP&gt;A metric defined as the ratio between the measured value and the expected value, expressed mathematically as A = (Y_measured * X_expected) / (Y_expected * X_measured).</data>
