  <data key="d2">Ideal Output represents the theoretical or desired result in a system, which is noted to have poor representation due to low resolution.&lt;SEP&gt;Ideal Output represents the theoretical or expected output of a system, serving as the reference standard against which the actual output is compared.</data>
