<node id="Percent Error">
  <data key="d0">Percent Error</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Percent error is a mathematical concept representing the relative difference between an actual value and a theoretical or accepted value, expressed as a percentage.&lt;SEP&gt;A calculated value representing the error as a percentage, defined by a specific mathematical formula involving expected value and absolute error.&lt;SEP&gt;A term associated with the deviation of the measured value from the expected value, linked to the definition of Relative Accuracy.</data>
  <data key="d3">chapter-1 Error in measurement::ch_00013-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;chapter-1 Error in measurement::ch_00010-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;chapter-1 Error in measurement::ch_00011-chunk-000</data>
