<node id="R-2R Ladder DAC">
  <data key="d0">R-2R Ladder DAC</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">A digital-to-analog conversion circuit that utilizes a specific resistor network configuration requiring only two distinct resistor values.&lt;SEP&gt;A digital-to-analog converter architecture that utilizes a network of resistors with only two distinct values, R and 2R, and does not require high precision resistors despite having a lower conversion speed compared to binary weighted DACs.</data>
  <data key="d3">chapter 5  ADC and DAC::ch_00014-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;chapter 5  ADC and DAC::ch_00018-chunk-000</data>
