</node>
<node id="D/A Conversion">
  <data key="d0">D/A Conversion</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">The process of converting digital data into an analog signal, for which the R-2R Ladder is described as a widely used method.&lt;SEP&gt;D/A Conversion is the process of converting signals from the digital domain to the analog domain, resulting in a staircase waveform output before filtering.</data>
  <data key="d3">chapter 5  ADC and DAC::ch_00014-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;chapter 5  ADC and DAC::ch_00003-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
