  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">The binary inputs (b0-b3) that are processed by the R-2R Ladder DAC, where each successive input has a gain that is half of the previous one.&lt;SEP&gt;Digital Input refers to the digital data fed into a system, such as a DAC, where a zero digital code is a specific state used to measure offset error.</data>
