  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Precision is defined as a numerical indication of the closeness with which repeated measurements of the same variable agree with the average of the set of measurements.&lt;SEP&gt;The statistical metric to be calculated for the fourth measurement</data>
