  <data key="d0">Offset Error</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Offset Error is a discrepancy that occurs when there is a constant offset between the actual output and the ideal output of a system, specifically defined as the difference between the ideal and actual DAC output when a zero digital code is applied.</data>
