<node id="Aliasing">
  <data key="d0">Aliasing</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A phenomenon in signal processing that occurs when an input signal changes much faster than the sample rate, causing the frequency of the reconstructed signal to be incorrectly lower than the original.</data>
  <data key="d3">chapter 5  ADC and DAC::ch_00020-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
